WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
The string goes tight in the wind

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
A red kite climbs above the field

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Hold on, the current lifts it higher

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Clouds slide past the paper wings

00:48.000 --> 01:04.000
Let out the line and watch it turn

01:04.000 --> 01:20.000
The tail writes circles in the blue

01:20.000 --> 01:40.000
Wind in the hands, quiet on the ground

01:40.000 --> 02:00.000
Bring it down before the light goes

02:00.000 --> 02:23.000
Fold the kite and wind the string
